      "grid_message_index_0based": 0,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ヨワクナールガス搭載の散布ドローン。\nそして寄生された宇宙船をなんとかするため、\n主人公一行はクルクリの元を訪れていた。",
      "jp_sha256": "4c24326280cd469c5661cdbf3e916a3a1d5487cb9c679fcfa1f6c366c5cc6398",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "요와쿠나루 가스 탑재 살포 드론.\n그리고 기생당한 우주선을 어떻게든 하기 위해\n주인공 일행은 쿠르쿠리를 찾아왔다.",
      "message_index_0based": 0,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 8,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "3b0cb1d023fb0fc0463aba2044fba7f247a5180bb2588730cca119d22f3fc36d:000002_122706471453118207:g0:r7",
      "row_index_0based": 7,
      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ヨワクナールガス搭載の散布ドローン。\nそして寄生された宇宙船をなんとかするため、\n主人公一行はクルクリの元を訪れていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "fe8fe66027269bfd396bb0c3f442f3836a6243afbd3c9275dd0fef65920b37f8",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "――寄生生物に空飛ぶ兵器か。そんな事があったとはねぇ。\nそれで強い武器を求めて、あたいのところに来たってワケかい。",
      "jp_sha256": "c4a3d0abc70c8a6ab72d59af3e58bc886fb8a3509c6c025c5cb10b36c1438690",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "――기생 생물에 하늘을 나는 병기라. 그런 일이 있었구나.\n그래서 강한 무기를 찾아 나한테 왔다는 거냐.",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "3b0cb1d023fb0fc0463aba2044fba7f247a5180bb2588730cca119d22f3fc36d:000002_122706471453118207:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "クルクリ",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "――寄生生物に空飛ぶ兵器か。そんな事があったとはねぇ。\nそれで強い武器を求めて、あたいのところに来たってワケかい。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "クルクリ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "ce86a707e12324784fa4640f5620c5599d5ee01f95d4345627e17efcdc90ab01",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ええ、心当たりはないでしょうか？",
      "jp_sha256": "42c584c6eb1c688d1d2c80da93af092abc563a02690875668b248a96ca971f9c",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "네, 짐작 가는 게 없으신가요?",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 10,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "3b0cb1d023fb0fc0463aba2044fba7f247a5180bb2588730cca119d22f3fc36d:000002_122706471453118207:g0:r9",
      "row_index_0based": 9,
      "serialized_row_index": 9,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ええ、心当たりはないでしょうか？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "ea97ac6ca253fdd905f4a50ca54627d499739d6e61cd66f91fa039ffaf80ab3f",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ご主人、ツイてるなぁ。\n心当たりならあるぜ、ちょうど手入れをしてたところだ。",
      "jp_sha256": "b8f3fee0a6f2919d534739eaadc60f5e6a504b0891770bb17a5534da92db318d",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "주인, 운이 좋네.\n짐작 가는 게 있어. 마침 손질하던 참이었거든.",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 13,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "3b0cb1d023fb0fc0463aba2044fba7f247a5180bb2588730cca119d22f3fc36d:000002_122706471453118207:g0:r12",
      "row_index_0based": 12,
      "serialized_row_index": 12,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "クルクリ",
        "Emt3_Gla",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "ご主人、ツイてるなぁ。\n心当たりならあるぜ、ちょうど手入れをしてたところだ。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "クルクリ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "d58cf1749758386a02985913244951b5c84560b79d110b77a849e5cd2077f22c",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ほんとですか！？\nドローンも宇宙船も撃ち落とせる兵器が本当に！？",
      "jp_sha256": "9bb1a91374bf0ba7186d143cd21b5490cd41bd41f81e5adc867afdc03dbeef09",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "정말입니까!?\n드론도 우주선도 격추할 수 있는 병기가 진짜로!?",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 28,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
