    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "a0a5f1ef9d322c829c45c510d8636d844c9e63a7cbf6171cf60f5deafcf3f756",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 6,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "クルクリが指した方を目で追うと、\nそこには据え置き型の大型弩砲――バリスタがあった。",
      "jp_sha256": "d838710a27cad800e06d0e4eca8ccb6351bf90cd1f9e011807d94221c2819425",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "쿠르쿠리가 가리킨 방향으로 시선을 옮기자\n그곳에는 설치형 대형 쇠뇌―― 발리스타가 있었다.",
      "message_index_0based": 6,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 35,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "3b0cb1d023fb0fc0463aba2044fba7f247a5180bb2588730cca119d22f3fc36d:000002_122706471453118207:g0:r34",
      "row_index_0based": 34,
      "serialized_row_index": 34,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "クルクリが指した方を目で追うと、\nそこには据え置き型の大型弩砲――バリスタがあった。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "88451f526af425441ec5110f62161dfc58fc5d375c8752306ef0c806af98b66f",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 7,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ハッ！　なんダ、この原始的武器ハ！\nやはり劣等種だナ！　こんなモノが役に立つカ！",
      "jp_sha256": "30f835be1d1b2c6ed9c49e46972ac09c3ece02ba523367e4cf5f81699d2c223f",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "하! 뭐냐, 이 원시적인 무기는!\n역시 열등종이군! 이런 게 도움이 되겠나!",
      "message_index_0based": 7,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 36,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "3b0cb1d023fb0fc0463aba2044fba7f247a5180bb2588730cca119d22f3fc36d:000002_122706471453118207:g0:r35",
      "row_index_0based": 35,
      "serialized_row_index": 35,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "プリプリダ",
        "Emt7_Ama",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "ハッ！　なんダ、この原始的武器ハ！\nやはり劣等種だナ！　こんなモノが役に立つカ！",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "プリプリダ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "6ceb59f6aa0725e45e902a778ea970872b07b43ee1cd8d4d914840f35a44caab",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 8,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "まあ、そう思うよな。\nでも威力の方は――――ポチッとな。",
      "jp_sha256": "999fe74784beb116569086a05fef3fca7c31cbddc68f54f7ce658a8ca3e5b1f0",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "뭐, 그렇게 생각하겠지.\n하지만 위력은―――― 꾸욱.",
      "message_index_0based": 8,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 39,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
